--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
B. PERSONAL CV CONTENT — all rights reserved: do NOT reuse
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Applies to: data/cv.yaml.age and data/cv.yaml (the same content, encrypted and
clear), i.e. the CV text itself — name, contact details, employment history,
education, languages, certificates, project descriptions — plus the rendered
outputs (cv.pdf, web/index.html) and web/preview.png.

You may NOT copy, reproduce, modify, redistribute or reuse this personal
content, in whole or in part, for your own CV or for any other purpose,
without prior written permission from the author. Reading it for reference is
fine; republishing it (or a lightly edited copy of it) is not.

